  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Market Study Processed Food, Olive Oil and Dates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands is a key European trade hub for food products, combining strong consumer demand, sophisticated retail and foodservice channels, and an advanced import and re-export ecosystem. For Palestinian exporters, the Netherlands can be both a direct destination and a gateway to wider European Union (EU) distribution - provided that product-market fit, regulatory compliance, pricing, and buyer targeting are addressed with high-quality market intelligence.Currently the trade flow from Palestinian Territories to The Netherlands (NL) is small and as part of a consolidated effort to increase the trade flow whole reducing logistics cost with a trade hub in NL, it is key that the trade potential for key products and commodities is quantified and more links into the Dutch and European trade networks are established. Based on a pre-selection of high-potential Palestinian products for the NL/EU market, a practical market study will be delivered and business-to-business (B2B) linkages with Dutch buyers facilitated to provide a realistic perspective for Palestinian suppliers and accommodate and expand market access.</narrative>
  </description>
